# Local agent/runtime state is durable outside git only. Do not commit runtime
# plans, sessions, checkpoints, HUD state, logs, or verification scratch under
# harness state dirs. Frozen keep-with-sunset brand residue (ADR-0709): only the
# four exact paths below may stay tracked under .omc/ultragoal — do not expand.
# friction-ledger.jsonl is CI load-bearing (ledger_path) until a future rehome.
/.omc/*
!/.omc/ultragoal/
/.omc/ultragoal/*
!/.omc/ultragoal/OWNERS
!/.omc/ultragoal/TEAMMATE-PREAMBLE.md
!/.omc/ultragoal/friction-ledger.jsonl
!/.omc/ultragoal/premise.txt
# Nested session dirt under docs/ (accidentally tracked historically; never re-commit)
docs/**/.omc/
/.omx/
# Local GJC runtime/session state is never committed.
# Specs/plans promoted to product authority belong in tracked specs/docs/registry files.
/.gjc/_session-*/
/.gjc/state/notifications/
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

